  def caveats
    <<~EOS
      dev-domains installs caddy automatically via Homebrew dependencies.

      Important paths:
        #{opt_pkgshare}/caddy/Caddyfile
        #{opt_pkgshare}/caddy/apps
        #{opt_pkgshare}/docs

      First-time setup:
        dev-domains setup

      That command will:
        - start or restart caddy
